:''For the first, stronger form, see [[Dessert Witch - Obsession]].''
'''Dessert Witch''' (お菓子の魔女, ''Okashi no Majo'', '''Sweets Witch''') is a [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dessert Witch
|image = E 275.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy can do a fair bit of damage but is hampered by its somewhat low health and abysmal range.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]], [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]], or any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] from [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event|the collaboration event]], use them. Since both forms of the Dessert Witch are [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witches]], they will become much easier to defeat with the collab units' Witch Killer ability.

